    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105873" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυμβ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bury,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα τυμβεῦσαι τάφῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1063
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1245
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῦ δ᾽ ἐτυμβεύθη τάφῳ;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					885
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				5.549
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρὶ τυμβεῦσαι χοάς</span>
			<i>pour</i> libations <i>on</i> his <i>grave,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				406
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>dwell entombed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοιαύτῃ ζῶσα τυμβεύειν στέγῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					888
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
